-- Vault · Nutrition (category id recipes), rewritten in the house voice (docs/VAULT_VOICE.md).
-- Nine lessons in reading order, every piece with the loop, a quiz, risks and verified references.
-- Numbers follow the registry: protein 1.6–2.2 g/kg/day in 3 or 4 meals of about 0.4 g/kg per meal; before training
